  } catch (error) {
    handleApiError(res, error, "update-page");
  }
});
```

## Additional Block Types

To fully support all Notion block types, implement the missing block creation functions I mentioned earlier (createCalloutBlock, createToDoBlock, etc.) and add them to your block-utils.js file.

This approach will convert your markdown-style input into proper Notion blocks, giving you the rich formatting you're looking for instead of plain text.

